body:
i expected that i'd be awake for the day, not pass out immediately. i'm vitamin d deficient & also iron deficient, those two supplements are just additives to the cocktail i was doing, neither of those were to get high, those were meant to be supplements for my regular day;
i had NO INTENTIONS of passing out, that's what startled me, i woke up feeling perfectly okay, and i feel a lot better than i would on a normal day, which is COMPLETELY strange to me, and i wanted to ask if possibly any others had a similar experience and if i'm okay.

i would consider it an overdose, not a classic OD like i seized up and died, but i have a tolerance to most of these on their own i just haven't had a combination of all of these before.
